<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1986</h1><p class="ref-lede">1986 in world history: 27 events, 1 birth, 15 deaths, 1 work and 3 states founded. 254 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
