<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/commonwealth-of-australia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Commonwealth%20of%20Australia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Commonwealth of Australia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Australia Act ends the remaining legal links with Britain</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/south-yemen"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/South%20Yemen.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>South Yemen</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Party civil war in Aden kills thousands, including Abdul Fattah Ismail</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/socialist-republic-of-vietnam"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Socialist%20Republic%20of%20Vietnam.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Socialist Republic of Vietnam</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Sixth Party Congress adopts the Doi Moi market reforms</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/uganda"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Uganda.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Uganda</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The National Resistance Army takes Kampala and Museveni becomes president</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-chimor"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Chimor.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Chimor</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Chan Chan becomes a UNESCO World Heritage Site and is listed as in danger</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/sanxingdui-culture"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Sanxingdui%20culture.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Sanxingdui culture</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Local workers find two sacrificial pits filled with broken and burned gold, bronze, jade and pottery objects</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-austria"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Austria.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Austria</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Kurt Waldheim, former secretary-general of the United Nations and a Wehrmacht officer accused of war crimes, is elected president.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-haiti"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Haiti.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Haiti</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Jean-Claude 'Baby Doc' Duvalier leaves the country under US pressure after nationwide demonstrations.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/ukrainian-ssr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ukrainian%20SSR.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ukrainian SSR</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Chernobyl disaster turned many Ukrainians against Soviet rule</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/domesday-book"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Domesday%20Book.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Domesday Book</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The volumes are rebound for the ninth centenary, and the BBC releases the Domesday Project</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/stonehenge"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Stonehenge.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Stonehenge</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Stonehenge and its surroundings were added to the list of World Heritage Sites</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/manila"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Manila.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Manila</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The People Power Revolution ends the rule of Ferdinand Marcos</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/ife"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ife.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ife</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Yoruba Orisha Congress is formed, and the Ọọ̀ni gains an international standing</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/chan-chan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Chan%20Chan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Chan Chan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">UNESCO designates Chan Chan a World Heritage Site and lists it as in danger</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/statue-of-liberty"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Statue%20of%20Liberty.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Statue of Liberty</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">After a restoration that replaced the whole iron armature and the torch, the statue was rededicated</span></li></ul></section>
